          {
            "id": "cc067107-9048-4f10-ac8e-11d20b11af20",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "15a6f652-6d59-4350-affe-947262be38c2",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "4a91bd49-385e-43be-af1d-1be9b15c2c34",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Dot: The bell wire\ngoes to this\nantenna. Its brass\ntag says SEND\nNORTH. The vane",
                      "points toward\nAurora when its\narrow meets the\nnotch. Wind moved\nthe vane, but the",
                      "notch is still cut\ninto the stone."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "0c3939b3-3a45-428d-af29-ae5efb61754e",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "7f227bed-27bb-4342-ac13-0121fb555c33",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
            "value": 1
          }
        }
      },
      "children": {
        "true": [
          {
            "id": "5c829ecd-f58e-4196-ab2c-670b821fae58",
            "command": "EVENT_GROUP",
            "args": {},
            "children": {
              "true": [
                {
                  "id": "6b8cfdb6-bae2-4d2f-ac2f-51150ab6af4b",
                  "command": "EVENT_HIDE_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                },
                {
                  "id": "2ef1f2b9-b722-4d78-a989-15138ab1c328",
                  "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                  "args": {
                    "text": [
                      "Three entries\nsurvive in the\nwatch log. At\nseven, the roof\nsent its alarm. At",
                      "eight, Aurora\nrecorded that\nalarm. At nine,\nAurora attempted a\nreply, but no roof",
                      "receipt was\nlogged. Dot points\nout that the first\ntwo entries show a\nsuccessful outward",
                      "path. A later\nproblem may affect\nthe return path\nwithout erasing\nthe earlier",
                      "delivery. The\nwatch keeper wants\nhis crew cleared\nof a false\naccusation."
                    ],
                    "avatarId": "",
                    "minHeight": 4,
                    "maxHeight": 7,
                    "position": "bottom",
                    "closeWhen": "key",
                    "closeButton": "a"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "9cc57373-4861-403d-ac8b-31c81fe8d7d7",
                  "command": "EVENT_SHOW_SPRITES",
                  "args": {}
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "false": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "395328c3-ab47-439f-a377-48971b442317",
      "command": "EVENT_IF",
      "args": {
        "condition": {
          "type": "gt",
          "valueA": {
            "type": "variable",
            "value": "44"
          },
          "valueB": {
            "type": "number",
